# AICL Example: Palindrome
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Is palindrome

Layer:
Core

Behavior Check
    Input: text
    Output: result
    Action:
        left = 0
        right = len(text) - 1
        while left < right:
            if text[left] != text[right]:
                return false
            left = left + 1
            right = right - 1
        return true
